# T-06 agent bin/control.sh 动词实跑：12 臂
# 仓: wt-media-agent  日期: 2026-09-26  产物: 原样转录自 /tmp/t06-arms.txt（臂在真实健康台上跑）
#
# 端口是内核分配的临时高位端口，用 WT_MEDIA_AGENT_HEALTH_PORT 注入；PID/LOG 都改到
# /private/tmp 下的临时目录，**不动本仓 .cache/**，也**不碰本机开发台的 18765**。
#
# 判读（10 条功能臂）：
#   arm1  start            首次启动并等到 /healthz 应答 → exit=0, pid=86409
#   arm2  start 重复       幂等：认领已有 pid，不启第二个 → exit=0
#   arm3  status 运行中     alive=yes health=ok 两项并报 → exit=0
#   arm4  restart          先停后起，pid 变了（86409 → 86446） → exit=0
#   arm5  status 重启后    仍 alive=yes health=ok → exit=0
#   arm6  stop             停掉 → exit=0
#   arm7  status 停止后     alive=no health=down → **exit=1**（这就是 status 的判据：两项都成立才 0）
#   arm8  stop 重复         未运行 → 不报错，exit=0
#   arm9  未知动词          → 用法打到 stderr, exit=2
#  arm10  help / 无参       → usage, exit=0
#  收尾核对：该端口上无残留监听；临时目录只剩 agent.log（日志落点确实生效）；
#           工作树新增只有 bin/control.sh（另有开工前就存在的 AGENT-INDEX.md 改动，未触碰）。
#
# 判读（2 条变异臂）——§14 第 19 项的危害是**三仓共有的**，agent 也复现：
#  arm11 对照：替身子进程立刻退出、端口无人应答 → start 报 failed to stay running, exit=1（窗口关着）
#  arm12 变异：**外来进程占着端口**、替身子进程 2 秒后自杀
#        → start 探到 /healthz 有应答就报 started, exit=0（**假成功**）
#        → 3 秒后 status: alive=no health=ok, exit=1
#        即：端口先被占时，start 的探针无法区分「自己的子进程活着」与「别人的进程在应答」，
#        窗口在 start 返回后、子进程死亡前是打开的。cloud/workspace 同形（T-04/T-05 已各测一次）。
#        本 CHG 不修（属 §14 登记项，修的落点是 start 里加 pid 存活与探针的联合判据）。

PORT=60392 (free port from kernel)  PID/LOG under /private/tmp/t06.wt714k
=== arm 1 start ===
$ bin/control.sh start
wt-media-agent health started: 86409
exit=0

=== arm 2 start again ===
$ bin/control.sh start
wt-media-agent health already running: 86409
exit=0

=== arm 3 status while running ===
$ bin/control.sh status
agent: pid=86409 alive=yes health=ok url=http://127.0.0.1:60392/healthz
exit=0

=== arm 4 restart ===
$ bin/control.sh restart
wt-media-agent health stopped
wt-media-agent health started: 86446
exit=0

=== arm 5 status after restart ===
$ bin/control.sh status
agent: pid=86446 alive=yes health=ok url=http://127.0.0.1:60392/healthz
exit=0

=== arm 6 stop ===
$ bin/control.sh stop
wt-media-agent health stopped
exit=0

=== arm 7 status after stop ===
$ bin/control.sh status
agent: pid=- alive=no health=down url=http://127.0.0.1:60392/healthz
exit=1

=== arm 8 stop again ===
$ bin/control.sh stop
wt-media-agent health not running
exit=0

=== arm 9 unknown verb ===
$ bin/control.sh bogus
unknown command: bogus
Usage: bin/control.sh <command>

  start    Start the health server in the background and wait for /healthz.
  stop     Stop the process recorded by the PID file.
  restart  Stop, then start.
  status   Report whether that process is alive and whether the endpoint answers.
  help     Show this help.

Script-level overrides: PYTHON_BIN, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_HEALTH_HOST,
WT_MEDIA_AGENT_HEALTH_PORT, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_PID_FILE, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_LOG_FILE.
exit=2

=== arm 10 help ===
$ bin/control.sh help
Usage: bin/control.sh <command>

  start    Start the health server in the background and wait for /healthz.
  stop     Stop the process recorded by the PID file.
  restart  Stop, then start.
  status   Report whether that process is alive and whether the endpoint answers.
  help     Show this help.

Script-level overrides: PYTHON_BIN, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_HEALTH_HOST,
WT_MEDIA_AGENT_HEALTH_PORT, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_PID_FILE, WT_MEDIA_AGENT_LOG_FILE.
exit=0

