=== worktree (excluding the known pre-existing AGENT-INDEX.md edit) ===
?? bin/control.sh
=== arm 11 (control): stand-in child exits at once, nothing on the port ===
$ bin/control.sh start
wt-media-agent health failed to stay running
exit=1

=== arm 12 (mutation): a foreign process holds the port; stand-in child suicides after 2s ===
$ bin/control.sh start
wt-media-agent health started: 86699
exit=0

--- 3s later ---
$ bin/control.sh status
agent: pid=- alive=no health=ok url=http://127.0.0.1:60409/healthz
exit=1

bash: line 17: 86679 Terminated: 15          python3 "/private/tmp/t06mut.P2wusi/probe2.py" "${PORT}"

# 末行 `Terminated: 15` 是驱动脚本收尾时清理 arm12 遗留探针进程的 shell 通知，不是脚本输出。
